    <string name="guide_title">Guide</string>
    <string name="guide_intro">Three steps to read tonight\'s glow</string>
    <string name="guide_step1">Pick a place and date: search a city; dates go back 2 days and 15 days ahead. Dawn and dusk are computed separately.</string>
    <string name="guide_step2">Read the verdict: P is the chance of any glow, Q is how good it looks, and confidence comes from model spread.</string>
    <string name="guide_step3">Use trend and field map: the trend picks the day, the map picks the spot. Both need network and cache for 6 hours.</string>
    <string name="guide_open_web">Open the full guide (web, four tracks, three languages)</string>
    <string name="guide_note">The app keeps only this quick start; the full guide opens in your browser, with no embedded web view.</string>

